{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Of the dew of the heavens.</b> For the land of Canaan is given to my father's seed and to my seed, and rain falls there only twice a year — the yoreh in Marcheshvan and the malkosh in Sivan — so for the rest of the days of the year it needs dew from the heavens." "<b>And of the fatness of the land.</b> As it is said: ״חמאת בקר וחלב צאן״ (curds of cattle and milk of sheep)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:16.849976345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}